st a collateral damage to Rahul's early mid life crisis? Watch our newest Voot Original, Time Out.","releaseInfo":"2017","genres":["Hindi"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAxMS0yMDIwL0l0cy1Ob3QtVGhhdC1TaW1wbGUtJTI4MjAxNiUyOS8","type":"series","name":"Its Not That Simple","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/54fBEFalVIUjH8Jp5kdK82e7vaH.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2Kuggv08AEWTMZboJwaU3kRibJH.jpg","description":"An urban housewife is stuck in an unhappy marriage, until she's invited for a school reunion and meets two of her ex-almost-boyfriends.","releaseInfo":"2016","genres":["Hindi"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAxMS0yMDIwL0xpZmUtU2FoaS1IYWktJTI4MjAxNiUyOS8","type":"series","name":"Life Sahi Hai","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/7U3mNHnROcvfwF1Hp72cRwBNpMu.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zJIpXXicFYyUXgAQ2j52VCnFMzx.jpg","description":"Life Sahi Hai' is a sitcom that revolves around the lives of four guys who have moved to Delhi to live independently for the first time. They have a tendency to land in uncomfortable and what for us are hilarious, situations all the time. While dealing with bosses, girlfriends and with each other, these guys end up in such challenging situations, which only they are capable of landing themselves in. While they are getting used to the newfound freedom, they realize that freedom isn't free.[3] But despite all this, they can see the lighter side of life in everything, and keep believing that 'Life Sahi Hai'","releaseInfo":"2016","genres":["Hindi"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAxMS0yMDIwL0xpdHRsZS1UaGluZ3MtJTI4VFYtTWluaS1TZXJpZXMtMjAxNi0lMjktMTA4MHAv","type":"series","name":"Little Things (TV Mini Series 2016 ) 1080p","description":"Folder: Hindi","releaseInfo":"2016","genres":["Hindi"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMj