 the system into letting him go scott free.","releaseInfo":"2010","genres":["Hindi"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvUmlzaHRhLWNvbS0lMjgyMDEwLS0lMjkv","type":"series","name":"Rishta com","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/zjtrphwGk36uW9XurmUmPb0S8r6.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jWaAvfstus9kUydNMBVZlgjF74U.jpg","description":"The story of two contrasting individuals, Isha and Rahul, open a matrimonial agency and try to unite the matches made in heaven, on earth. But while accomplishing the most challenging job, they encounter extreme cases, and illogical requests of their clients.","releaseInfo":"2010","genres":["Hindi"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvVGFhcmFrLU1laHRhLUthLU9vbHRhaC1DaGFzaG1haC0lMjgyMDA4JTI5Lw","type":"series","name":"Taarak Mehta Ka Ooltah Chashmah","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/3p9EtiZJKV5L8CBYjjL2b4T8cWP.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ztBJOWaolee4DipbGeSJnCixk4F.jpg","description":"Inspired by the famous Gujarati column Duniya Ne Undha Chasma by Taarak Mehta, this show captures the everyday life in Gokuldham Co-operative Society, addressing socially relevant issues with humor. At its heart is Jethalal, an uneducated Gujarati businessman, who often seeks guidance from his wise neighbor and friend, Taarak Mehta. Jethalal lives with his naive yet lovable wife Daya Ben and their mischievous son Tapu, whose antics frequently disrupt the peace of the society. The members often warn Jethalal to control Tapu or face eviction. In desperation, he calls his father, Champaklal, from the village, hoping he’ll instill discipline in Tapu. Instead, the grandfather-grandson duo teams up, creating even more chaos and turning Jethalal’s life into a comedic roller coaster. The show blends family dynamics, friendship, and neighborhood bonds with a dose of satire and laughter.","releaseInfo":"2008","genres":["Hindi"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAxMC0tQmVmb3JlL0hhdGltJTIwJTI4MjAwMyUyOS8","type":"series","name":"Hatim","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/hoTQPG6DJmKkMGaR2idZmUwTbEE.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/crT3jaa4kCsgQ66cjwsBDE56xWb.jpg","description":"Hatim is an Indian television series that aired on StarPlus from 26 December 2003 until 12 November 2004. It has elements of fantasy, drama, and many other genres. It was directed by Amrit Sagar and is based on a Persian story recounting the adventures of Hatim al-Tai of the Tayyi tribe of Arabia.","releaseInfo":"2003","genres":["Hindi"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvVmlrcmFhbC1hbmQtR2FicmFhbC0lMjgyMDAzJTI5Lw","type":"series","name":"Vikraal and Gabraal","description":"Folder: Hindi","releaseInfo":"2003","genres":["Hindi"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAxMC0tQmVmb3JlL0NJRC0lMjgxOTk4LSUyOS8","type":"series","name":"CID","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/3UymnlLfLMKxG8OcFhSnAlnhQfZ.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1gZrOa2E9DOohEvSLLBJqus2zGu.jpg","description":"A team of dedicated men and women in the Crime Investigation Department will risk everything to solve Mumbai's toughest, most complicated crimes.","releaseInfo":"1998","genres":["Hindi"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvQWxpZi1MYWlsYS0xOTkzLTE5OTcv","type":"series","name":"Alif Laila 1993","description":"Folder: Hindi","releaseInfo":"1997","genres":["Hindi"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvQmhhcmF0LUVrLUtob2otMTk4OC8","type":"series","name":"Bharat Ek Khoj","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/eE327cvRMzngQTwMvbTSj6yoo74.jpg","description":"Bharat Ek Khoj is a 53-episode Indian historical drama based on the book The Discovery of India by Jawaharlal Nehru, that dramatically unfolds the 5000 year history of India from its beginnings to the coming of independence in 1947. The drama was directed, written and produced by Shyam Benegal with cinematographer V. K. Murthy in 1988 for state-owned Doordarshan. Benegal's regular script collaborator Shama Zaidi also co-wrote the script.","releaseInfo":"1988","genres":["Hindi"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAxMS0yMDIwL0ZvcmJpZGRlbi1Mb3ZlLSUyOFRWLU1pbmktc2VyaWVzLTIwMjAlMjkvNzIwcC8","type":"series","name":"720p","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/5R125JAIh1N38pzHp2dRsBpOVNY.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AhufsCP0kYIkpr0Iy2GrLSM1noL.jpg","description":"Tom Kirkman, a low-level cabinet member is suddenly appointed President of the United States after a catastrophic attack during the State of the Union kills everyone above him in the Presidential line of succession.","genres":["Hindi"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyMS9EZXYtREQtJTI4SGluZGktc2VyaWVzLTIwMjElMjkvRGV2LURELVNlYXNvbi0xLTcyMHAv","type":"series","name":"Dev DD Season 1 720p","description":"Folder: Hindi","genres":["Hindi"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyMS9EZXYtREQtJTI4SGluZGktc2VyaWVzLTIwMjElMjkvRGV2LURELVNlYXNvbi0yLTcyMHAv","type":"series","name":"Dev DD Season 2 720p","description":"Folder: Hindi","genres":["Hindi"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvU3VtaXQtU2FtYmhhbC1MZWdhLSUyODIwMTUlMjktNzIwcC9FcGlzb2RlLTEtdG8tNDUv","type":"series","name":"Episode 1 to 45","description":"Folder: Hindi","genres":["Hindi"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvU3VtaXQtU2FtYmhhbC1MZWdhLSUyODIwMTUlMjktNzIwcC9FcGlzb2RlLTQ2LXRvLTc4Lw","type":"series","name":"Episode 46 to 78","description":"Folder: Hindi","genres":["Hindi"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvU3VtaXQtU2FtYmhhbC1MZWdhLSUyODIwMTUlMjktNzIwcC9FcGlzb2RlLTc5LXRvLTEwOC8","type":"series","name":"Epi